<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<appendix xml:id="appendix-factoring-and-expansion-revisited" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Factoring and Expansion Revisited</title>

  <p>
    Some portions of this appendix rely on content from <xref ref="sec-exponents" /> on radicals and <xref ref="sec-factoring-and-expansion" /> on factoring and expansion.
    This material can be skipped if there is a time constraint, and without any significant loss in the essence of algebra as a whole.
    This appendix is currently UNDER CONSTRUCTION, and below we see some sample problems that will be included in the final version.
  </p>

  <p>
    Rationalize the denominator of <m>\frac{2}{\sqrt{7}}</m>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Rationalize the denominator of <m>\frac{2}{\sqrt[3]{7}}</m>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Rationalize the denominator of <m>\frac{2}{10-\sqrt{7}}</m>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Factor <m>c^2 + 8</m>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Factor <m>c^2 - 8</m>.
  </p>

</appendix>